        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>魔蝠向周边5尺范围内的一个生物喷出泥巴。如果目标生物为中型或更小体型，则其必须成功通过一次DC 11的敏捷豁免，否则被束缚1分钟。该生物可以在其自己每回合结束时再次进行该豁免，豁免成功则终止该效应。</p><p>The mephit belches viscid mud onto one creature within 5 feet of it. If the target is Medium or smaller, it must succeed on a [[/save ability=dex dc=11]] saving throw or be &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p></div>",
